(6469101, 961573, 57229, '<td valign="top">Browsing the entries on an i-pad, my fat fingers hit one of those tool icons over the commenting box, which effectively registers that I have commented. I still haven''t, as you see, but here we go...<br/>This is  a good butterfly shot, both wings open and the eyes in focus. Shame about the missing bit. I often wondered if butterfly wings are as big as they are in order to get a second chance after bird attacks - they still seem to fly ok even when they''re extensively damaged.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Browsing the entries on an i-pad, my fat fingers hit one of those tool icons over the commenting box, which effectively registers that I have commented. I still haven''t, as you see, but here we go...This is  a good butterfly shot, both wings open and the eyes in focus. Shame about the missing bit. I often wondered if butterfly wings are as big as they are in order to get a second chance after bird attacks - they still seem to fly ok even when they''re extensively damaged.Good luck.', '2011-07-13 07:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
