(6469285, 961351, 65234, '<td valign="top">Intriguing, but I''d like to see more detail.  I think I see bits and pieces of bug but I''m not sure.  And I like bug detail ;-)</td>', 'Intriguing, but I''d like to see more detail.  I think I see bits and pieces of bug but I''m not sure.  And I like bug detail ;-)', '2011-07-13 11:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
