(6469288, 961691, 65234, '<td valign="top">Amazing how many sorts of bees there are!  Cute little guy, but I''d like to see him in better focus.</td>', 'Amazing how many sorts of bees there are!  Cute little guy, but I''d like to see him in better focus.', '2011-07-13 11:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469291, 961692, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, he''s almost cute!  Maybe it helps that I''m not seeing bazillions of spider eyeballs on this guy.  I might crop to get him a little more off-center but he was certainly a nice find for this challenge and I like the detail on him and his little shadow.</td>', 'Aw, he''s almost cute!  Maybe it helps that I''m not seeing bazillions of spider eyeballs on this guy.  I might crop to get him a little more off-center but he was certainly a nice find for this challenge and I like the detail on him and his little shadow.', '2011-07-13 11:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469295, 960971, 65234, '<td valign="top">Since spiders can cheerfully live almost anywhere I''m going to assume you did not bring this hairy beast into your studio for a shot!  Nice detail; I can''t often see their little feet on the web.</td>', 'Since spiders can cheerfully live almost anywhere I''m going to assume you did not bring this hairy beast into your studio for a shot!  Nice detail; I can''t often see their little feet on the web.', '2011-07-13 11:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469300, 961675, 65234, '<td valign="top">Are those little pinchers?  Title really suits the bug body language here!  Not the most detailed bug shot I''ve seen but conveying attitude in a small insect is an accomplishment.</td>', 'Are those little pinchers?  Title really suits the bug body language here!  Not the most detailed bug shot I''ve seen but conveying attitude in a small insect is an accomplishment.', '2011-07-13 11:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469301, 960998, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice caterpillar!  Would like to see the whole head in focus from this angle, I think, and I''d clone out that dark leafy thing on the bottom right.</td>', 'Nice caterpillar!  Would like to see the whole head in focus from this angle, I think, and I''d clone out that dark leafy thing on the bottom right.', '2011-07-13 12:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469303, 961870, 65234, '<td valign="top">True enough; most bugs are on the bottom end of the food chain.  Focus looks a little off here but the moment is perfect for this challenge (or my idea of it, anyway) as it shows a common event in bug life.</td>', 'True enough; most bugs are on the bottom end of the food chain.  Focus looks a little off here but the moment is perfect for this challenge (or my idea of it, anyway) as it shows a common event in bug life.', '2011-07-13 12:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469304, 961791, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the perspective but wish I could see the eyes more clearly.</td>', 'Like the perspective but wish I could see the eyes more clearly.', '2011-07-13 12:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469306, 961792, 65234, '<td valign="top">He''s cute combing through the flower bits.  Love the detail on the wing; would like the bee dodged some to bring out more detail there.</td>', 'He''s cute combing through the flower bits.  Love the detail on the wing; would like the bee dodged some to bring out more detail there.', '2011-07-13 12:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469316, 961967, 65234, '<td valign="top">But he''s bowing to you ;-)  Love the detail on those antennae!</td>', 'But he''s bowing to you ;-)  Love the detail on those antennae!', '2011-07-13 12:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469318, 961693, 65234, '<td valign="top">Um, yes.  Especially casting that l-o-n-g shadow on the wall!</td>', 'Um, yes.  Especially casting that l-o-n-g shadow on the wall!', '2011-07-13 12:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469320, 961713, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute setting and nice colours on the beetle.</td>', 'Cute setting and nice colours on the beetle.', '2011-07-13 12:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469323, 961573, 65234, '<td valign="top">It''s not easy being a butterfly.  He''s still beautiful.</td>', 'It''s not easy being a butterfly.  He''s still beautiful.', '2011-07-13 12:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469328, 961431, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely, rich colors.</td>', 'Lovely, rich colors.', '2011-07-13 12:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469342, 961810, 65234, '<td valign="top">Tough one to vote on.  The image itself shows me nothing of the fly''s environment, which isn''t what I''d hoped to see in this challenge.  You did get decent detail on the fly, which is no easy thing.</td>', 'Tough one to vote on.  The image itself shows me nothing of the fly''s environment, which isn''t what I''d hoped to see in this challenge.  You did get decent detail on the fly, which is no easy thing.', '2011-07-13 12:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469353, 961193, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very pretty bee, lightly dusted with pollen.  Bit of noise in the background that I''d blur out.</td>', 'Very pretty bee, lightly dusted with pollen.  Bit of noise in the background that I''d blur out.', '2011-07-13 12:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469358, 961925, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, a little Hoverfly.  They''re so cute :-)  Nice job capturing the detailed pattern on his back bits.</td>', 'Aw, a little Hoverfly.  They''re so cute :-)  Nice job capturing the detailed pattern on his back bits.', '2011-07-13 12:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469386, 961975, 129171, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, just doesn''t seem to have the clarity it should.</td>', 'Nice composition, just doesn''t seem to have the clarity it should.', '2011-07-13 12:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469388, 961866, 65234, '<td valign="top">OMG; however did you manage to find this!!  Exceptional moment to capture.  Looks like you might have had to resort to flash but ... amazing capture all the same.</td>', 'OMG; however did you manage to find this!!  Exceptional moment to capture.  Looks like you might have had to resort to flash but ... amazing capture all the same.', '2011-07-13 12:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469389, 961376, 129171, '<td valign="top">Hairy beast :-)</td>', 'Hairy beast :-)', '2011-07-13 12:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469390, 961953, 129171, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, just not clear enough on the insect.</td>', 'I like the idea, just not clear enough on the insect.', '2011-07-13 12:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469394, 961273, 83184, '<td valign="top">Haha! Well done!</td>', 'Haha! Well done!', '2011-07-13 12:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469397, 961939, 65234, '<td valign="top">Almost looke like a spider with wings =:-0  Funky moth; wish his antennae were up, just ''cuz I think moth antennae are really interesting.</td>', 'Almost looke like a spider with wings =:-0  Funky moth; wish his antennae were up, just ''cuz I think moth antennae are really interesting.', '2011-07-13 12:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469399, 961862, 65234, '<td valign="top">Just a widdle Hoverfly.  They''re harmless and IMO kinda'' cute.  Nice capture of him.</td>', 'Just a widdle Hoverfly.  They''re harmless and IMO kinda'' cute.  Nice capture of him.', '2011-07-13 12:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469400, 961772, 83184, '<td valign="top">Wow! No really, wow!</td>', 'Wow! No really, wow!', '2011-07-13 12:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469401, 961923, 129171, '<td valign="top">The dragonfly is rather overpowered by the flower.</td>', 'The dragonfly is rather overpowered by the flower.', '2011-07-13 12:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469405, 961395, 83184, '<td valign="top">Stunning color!</td>', 'Stunning color!', '2011-07-13 12:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469406, 961194, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the perspective.</td>', 'Like the perspective.', '2011-07-13 12:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469410, 961210, 83184, '<td valign="top">Is is waving at me!? Good photo!</td>', 'Is is waving at me!? Good photo!', '2011-07-13 12:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469411, 961309, 129171, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and composition but the but is lost on the flower.</td>', 'Nice colours and composition but the but is lost on the flower.', '2011-07-13 12:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469413, 961783, 83184, '<td valign="top">Brilliant focus!</td>', 'Brilliant focus!', '2011-07-13 12:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469414, 961975, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s a different bug!  Nice find.  I might have tried to reduce the noise in his wing a bit.</td>', 'Well, that''s a different bug!  Nice find.  I might have tried to reduce the noise in his wing a bit.', '2011-07-13 12:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469415, 961772, 129171, '<td valign="top">Gruesome.</td>', 'Gruesome.', '2011-07-13 12:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469416, 961892, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yes, you have made me feel sorry for the bug.  Great job with the perspective and processing.</td>', 'Yes, you have made me feel sorry for the bug.  Great job with the perspective and processing.', '2011-07-13 12:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469417, 961755, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Great title and unusual bug (at least for me).</td>', 'LOL!  Great title and unusual bug (at least for me).', '2011-07-13 12:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469418, 961862, 83184, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot! The green is beautiful!</td>', 'Stunning shot! The green is beautiful!', '2011-07-13 12:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469420, 961905, 129171, '<td valign="top">Shame the dragonfly doesn''t stand out against the background.</td>', 'Shame the dragonfly doesn''t stand out against the background.', '2011-07-13 12:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469422, 961877, 129171, '<td valign="top">Captivating.</td>', 'Captivating.', '2011-07-13 12:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469423, 961459, 65234, '<td valign="top">She''s lovely!  A bit dark on my screen, but lovely.</td>', 'She''s lovely!  A bit dark on my screen, but lovely.', '2011-07-13 12:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469424, 961836, 65234, '<td valign="top">Spiders have entirely too many eyeballs.</td>', 'Spiders have entirely too many eyeballs.', '2011-07-13 12:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469425, 961328, 129171, '<td valign="top">I prefer to see a little more light on the butterfly. Lovely specimen though.</td>', 'I prefer to see a little more light on the butterfly. Lovely specimen though.', '2011-07-13 12:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469426, 960758, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like he has a little fly or something sitting on him.  Could the little bug really be that dumb?</td>', 'Looks like he has a little fly or something sitting on him.  Could the little bug really be that dumb?', '2011-07-13 12:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469428, 961328, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty Lady!  Love the DOF and the OOF coneflower on the right, and the light is quite nice.  I think I''d crop much tighter on the left.</td>', 'Pretty Lady!  Love the DOF and the OOF coneflower on the right, and the light is quite nice.  I think I''d crop much tighter on the left.', '2011-07-13 12:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469429, 961883, 65234, '<td valign="top">Skipper!  Love those little guys; cheerfully flitting about and occasionally having disputes over who can land on which flower.  Nicely captured.</td>', 'Skipper!  Love those little guys; cheerfully flitting about and occasionally having disputes over who can land on which flower.  Nicely captured.', '2011-07-13 12:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469430, 961896, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lots of iridescence.  Almost pretty, up close like this.</td>', 'Lots of iridescence.  Almost pretty, up close like this.', '2011-07-13 12:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469431, 961912, 65234, '<td valign="top">Armed and dangerous.</td>', 'Armed and dangerous.', '2011-07-13 12:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469433, 960816, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cool find!</td>', 'Cool find!', '2011-07-13 12:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469435, 961350, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nice one! I like the soft light here. I''d guess this is some sort of robber fly.</td>', 'Nice one! I like the soft light here. I''d guess this is some sort of robber fly.', '2011-07-13 12:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469436, 961487, 65234, '<td valign="top">Are those Japanese Beetles?  You should not let them make MORE Japanese Beetles!</td>', 'Are those Japanese Beetles?  You should not let them make MORE Japanese Beetles!', '2011-07-13 12:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469443, 960772, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like he got sprinkled.  Love that I can see his toenails :-)  Not so much in love with the bright OOF blob in the foreground ... I''d be tempted to clone it out but that might be pushing the editing rules.</td>', 'Looks like he got sprinkled.  Love that I can see his toenails :-)  Not so much in love with the bright OOF blob in the foreground ... I''d be tempted to clone it out but that might be pushing the editing rules.', '2011-07-13 12:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469445, 961883, 129171, '<td valign="top">Aya aya Skipper</td>', 'Aya aya Skipper', '2011-07-13 12:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469447, 961372, 65234, '<td valign="top">Funky bug!</td>', 'Funky bug!', '2011-07-13 12:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469452, 961141, 65234, '<td valign="top">More likely a female (big) and male (small).  A lot of spider species are like that.  Interesting capture; could use a bit more detail (more DOF and/or dodging some details on the spiders).</td>', 'More likely a female (big) and male (small).  A lot of spider species are like that.  Interesting capture; could use a bit more detail (more DOF and/or dodging some details on the spiders).', '2011-07-13 12:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469457, 961249, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow, he reads Japanese!  Very impressive.  Not really sure that''s a wasp''s "natural environment," though it does look like a Paper Wasp LOL.</td>', 'Wow, he reads Japanese!  Very impressive.  Not really sure that''s a wasp''s "natural environment," though it does look like a Paper Wasp LOL.', '2011-07-13 12:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469458, 961801, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice eye contact.  It''s amazing how often you discover bugs are looking at you when you really pay attention =:-0</td>', 'Nice eye contact.  It''s amazing how often you discover bugs are looking at you when you really pay attention =:-0', '2011-07-13 12:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469463, 961367, 60614, '<td valign="top">Heheheheh got to love this disgusting thing.  You made the little guy look so cute.  Love the color tones and perspective.  Looks like you are seeing eye to million eyes.</td>', 'Heheheheh got to love this disgusting thing.  You made the little guy look so cute.  Love the color tones and perspective.  Looks like you are seeing eye to million eyes.', '2011-07-13 13:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469467, 961772, 54833, '<td valign="top">Wow. Creepy and disgusting. Nice shot though, so close and focused</td>', 'Wow. Creepy and disgusting. Nice shot though, so close and focused', '2011-07-13 13:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469469, 960758, 54833, '<td valign="top">How did you ever spot that? And what a creepy thought, it could be so close and nearly invisible. Nice find</td>', 'How did you ever spot that? And what a creepy thought, it could be so close and nearly invisible. Nice find', '2011-07-13 13:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469471, 961928, 54833, '<td valign="top">Very unique. Love that you shot it as it was hidden versus moving to see the whole insect. Very creative and the beads of water just really add a nice touch.</td>', 'Very unique. Love that you shot it as it was hidden versus moving to see the whole insect. Very creative and the beads of water just really add a nice touch.', '2011-07-13 13:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469474, 961628, 62094, '<td valign="top">He looks dead. is he dead?...</td>', 'He looks dead. is he dead?...', '2011-07-13 13:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469476, 961956, 54833, '<td valign="top">O their are some nasty bugs out there! :( But great colors and focus, very nice.</td>', 'O their are some nasty bugs out there! :( But great colors and focus, very nice.', '2011-07-13 13:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469479, 961273, 54833, '<td valign="top">Nice! Caught me off guard, my eyes had to refocus.</td>', 'Nice! Caught me off guard, my eyes had to refocus.', '2011-07-13 13:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469480, 961430, 129171, '<td valign="top">Stunning - colours, clarity, composition.</td>', 'Stunning - colours, clarity, composition.', '2011-07-13 13:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469483, 961725, 118154, '<td valign="top">Lovely light make this very near the top for me.</td>', 'Lovely light make this very near the top for me.', '2011-07-13 13:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469484, 961249, 129171, '<td valign="top">Shame the wing got cropped, but I like the mix of lettering and patterning on the wasp.</td>', 'Shame the wing got cropped, but I like the mix of lettering and patterning on the wasp.', '2011-07-13 13:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469485, 961950, 118154, '<td valign="top">Super stuff,hope to see this near top position.</td>', 'Super stuff,hope to see this near top position.', '2011-07-13 13:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469488, 961717, 129171, '<td valign="top">What a lovely flower.</td>', 'What a lovely flower.', '2011-07-13 13:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469489, 961957, 118154, '<td valign="top">Cracker of a shot,love it.</td>', 'Cracker of a shot,love it.', '2011-07-13 13:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469490, 961868, 118154, '<td valign="top">Background colour and lighting make this image stand out.</td>', 'Background colour and lighting make this image stand out.', '2011-07-13 13:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469492, 961809, 129171, '<td valign="top">Theres something about this that I''m not keen on, can''t put my finger on what, but the lighting is cleverly done.</td>', 'Theres something about this that I''m not keen on, can''t put my finger on what, but the lighting is cleverly done.', '2011-07-13 13:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469493, 961430, 118154, '<td valign="top">Great image.</td>', 'Great image.', '2011-07-13 13:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469494, 961884, 129171, '<td valign="top">Not easy to get these but a shame it''s not in focus and the colours are a bit bland.</td>', 'Not easy to get these but a shame it''s not in focus and the colours are a bit bland.', '2011-07-13 13:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469495, 961868, 129171, '<td valign="top">Lovely and bright.</td>', 'Lovely and bright.', '2011-07-13 13:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469496, 961957, 129171, '<td valign="top">Good character shot. It looks puzzled.</td>', 'Good character shot. It looks puzzled.', '2011-07-13 13:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469497, 961830, 129171, '<td valign="top">I like the background blur and the expression, and the balance of colours.</td>', 'I like the background blur and the expression, and the balance of colours.', '2011-07-13 13:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469499, 961784, 129171, '<td valign="top">Looks like</td>', 'Looks like', '2011-07-13 13:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469502, 961950, 129171, '<td valign="top">What a snooty expression!</td>', 'What a snooty expression!', '2011-07-13 13:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469504, 961760, 129171, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.</td>', 'Gorgeous.', '2011-07-13 13:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469506, 961939, 129171, '<td valign="top">I love the balance of colours between the foreground and background.</td>', 'I love the balance of colours between the foreground and background.', '2011-07-13 13:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469507, 961210, 129171, '<td valign="top">What an excellent pose!</td>', 'What an excellent pose!', '2011-07-13 13:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469508, 961740, 129171, '<td valign="top">Wow, capturing them flying is a different ballgame altogether!</td>', 'Wow, capturing them flying is a different ballgame altogether!', '2011-07-13 13:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469509, 961897, 54833, '<td valign="top">Great shot of his face and love the title, it''s perfect as I recall buzzing around the bugs for a change of pace. :-)</td>', 'Great shot of his face and love the title, it''s perfect as I recall buzzing around the bugs for a change of pace. :-)', '2011-07-13 13:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
