(6475043, 961273, 112736, '<td valign="top">I had a really similar idea, but the weather was absolute crap all week so I could never get the shot I wanted!  Kudos for going the distance!</td>', 'I had a really similar idea, but the weather was absolute crap all week so I could never get the shot I wanted!  Kudos for going the distance!', '2011-07-19 02:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475151, 960820, 116704, '<td valign="top">not really sure what is going on here. It looks like an electron micrograph. Composition is not too bad there are some nice forms but I have no idea how this ties into the rest. Maybe a caption would have helped</td>', 'not really sure what is going on here. It looks like an electron micrograph. Composition is not too bad there are some nice forms but I have no idea how this ties into the rest. Maybe a caption would have helped', '2011-07-19 08:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475153, 961893, 116704, '<td valign="top">with this type of contest everyone is going to do a macro. What sets one apart is adherence to photography rules. Your subject looks accidentally hidden, but it is well placed in the frame.</td>', 'with this type of contest everyone is going to do a macro. What sets one apart is adherence to photography rules. Your subject looks accidentally hidden, but it is well placed in the frame.', '2011-07-19 08:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
