(6475181, 960995, 116704, '<td valign="top">I had to come back and give this one a ten. Everyone pretty much successfully or unsuccessfully photographed a macro. This one didn''t. Instead focused on a pattern and not a bug portrait. Great job being different.</td>', 'I had to come back and give this one a ten. Everyone pretty much successfully or unsuccessfully photographed a macro. This one didn''t. Instead focused on a pattern and not a bug portrait. Great job being different.', '2011-07-19 08:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6475200, 961974, 100831, '<td valign="top">gotta love it... reminds me of a quote by Piet Mondrian (had to look it up to get it right) "The emotion of beauty is always obscured by the appearance of the object. Therefore the object must be eliminated from the picture".<br/>Okay well yours isn''t completely obliterated but you get what I mean.</td>', 'gotta love it... reminds me of a quote by Piet Mondrian (had to look it up to get it right) "The emotion of beauty is always obscured by the appearance of the object. Therefore the object must be eliminated from the picture".Okay well yours isn''t completely obliterated but you get what I mean.', '2011-07-19 09:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
