(6475774, 961740, 69324, '<td valign="top">I hope you get the credit you deserve for this entry.  I tried for three hours to get a similar shot at a local lake and didn''t get one keeper out of 150 shots. NV, as I have an entry in this challenge also, if I were voting I''d of given you a nine.</td>', 'I hope you get the credit you deserve for this entry.  I tried for three hours to get a similar shot at a local lake and didn''t get one keeper out of 150 shots. NV, as I have an entry in this challenge also, if I were voting I''d of given you a nine.', '2011-07-19 21:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
