(6475935, 961080, 2333, '<td valign="top">I''m bumping this up, because I love the lighting, the low-key look. The dark foreground really works well here too. Great find! I really like to photograph Harvestmen, they make great subjects.</td>', 'I''m bumping this up, because I love the lighting, the low-key look. The dark foreground really works well here too. Great find! I really like to photograph Harvestmen, they make great subjects.', '2011-07-19 23:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
