(6475938, 961493, 2333, '<td valign="top">Good capture, I like that you can see how his color pattern works as camouflage. I don''t know if I like the hornworms better as subjects, or the adult Sphinx Moths?</td>', 'Good capture, I like that you can see how his color pattern works as camouflage. I don''t know if I like the hornworms better as subjects, or the adult Sphinx Moths?', '2011-07-19 23:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
