(6476112, 961772, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  What a crazy photo to get.  Probably the closest shot you''ll ever have of your own blood. :)  I''m simply amazed at how sharp this is on the back of your hand, which is hard enough to keep still without a bug sucking the life out of you.  Was the camera on a tripod?</td>', 'Congrats!  What a crazy photo to get.  Probably the closest shot you''ll ever have of your own blood. :)  I''m simply amazed at how sharp this is on the back of your hand, which is hard enough to keep still without a bug sucking the life out of you.  Was the camera on a tripod?', '2011-07-20 01:37:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6476113, 961194, 62357, '<td valign="top">Well, I had no idea this was yours Deb, but it got a 7 from me :)  Very refreshing not to have yet another macro/close up shot.  Your comments made me smile :)</td>', 'Well, I had no idea this was yours Deb, but it got a 7 from me :)  Very refreshing not to have yet another macro/close up shot.  Your comments made me smile :)', '2011-07-20 01:37:24.000000', NULL, 0),
