(6477495, 961896, 3746, '<td valign="top">To capture iridescence like this is no mean feat - hugely under-rated IMHO.</td>', 'To capture iridescence like this is no mean feat - hugely under-rated IMHO.', '2011-07-21 05:13:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6477496, 961896, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Simms:</b></div><hr/><i> To capture iridescence like this is no mean feat - hugely under-rated IMHO. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you. I''m an absolute beginner in macro photography, so I didn''t expect an outstanding result, but I was quite impressed about what the 5D was able to do at high ISO settings (and also, denoising software''s efficiency). Iridescence was killed in my tries with flash strobes, so I tried with ambiant light only (on a very cloudy and windy day). A great learning experience.</td>', 'Originally posted by Simms: To capture iridescence like this is no mean feat - hugely under-rated IMHO.   Thank you. I''m an absolute beginner in macro photography, so I didn''t expect an outstanding result, but I was quite impressed about what the 5D was able to do at high ISO settings (and also, denoising software''s efficiency). Iridescence was killed in my tries with flash strobes, so I tried with ambiant light only (on a very cloudy and windy day). A great learning experience.', '2011-07-21 05:29:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6477521, 961351, 117474, '<td valign="top">Well, I really liked this anyway!</td>', 'Well, I really liked this anyway!', '2011-07-21 07:27:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6477523, 961896, 117474, '<td valign="top">Initially I thought this was a little too colourful, but the more I look at it the more I like it. Nice shot. Love the eyes. Great ''teeth'' too. I think the iridescence gives the impression that it''s out of focus even though it''s not. That probably hit you in a few votes.</td>', 'Initially I thought this was a little too colourful, but the more I look at it the more I like it. Nice shot. Love the eyes. Great ''teeth'' too. I think the iridescence gives the impression that it''s out of focus even though it''s not. That probably hit you in a few votes.', '2011-07-21 07:37:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6477524, 961830, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey sandy .. what a great finish for a brilliant shot .. there were some extraordinary shots in this challenge and this is one of them .. i just love the colouring and the beautiful surroundings of that little wasp .. a truly beautiful image .. :)</td>', 'hey sandy .. what a great finish for a brilliant shot .. there were some extraordinary shots in this challenge and this is one of them .. i just love the colouring and the beautiful surroundings of that little wasp .. a truly beautiful image .. :)', '2011-07-21 07:59:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6477526, 961830, 67145, '<td valign="top">hadnt read your comments when i posted that last comment .. thankyou for the hugest compliment .. :)x<br/>but sandy .. you are too modest .. everything you touch turns to gold in your photography .. people, animals, birds, frogs, lizards and of course insects .. to name a few .. you turn photography into art and beauty .. you are amazing .. :)<br/></td>', 'hadnt read your comments when i posted that last comment .. thankyou for the hugest compliment .. :)xbut sandy .. you are too modest .. everything you touch turns to gold in your photography .. people, animals, birds, frogs, lizards and of course insects .. to name a few .. you turn photography into art and beauty .. you are amazing .. :)', '2011-07-21 08:05:08.000000', NULL, 0),
