(6553841, 961956, 60614, '<td valign="top">Wow this is good.  I took a photo of one of these assassin bugs attacking a pine bore in my pine tree.  Your photo is way better than mine.  My assassin bug was orange with black and white stripe legs.  Bizarre creature.  I just bought this lens and have been looking for this bug again to see if I could get a better shot.  No such luck.  Nicely done photo.</td>', 'Wow this is good.  I took a photo of one of these assassin bugs attacking a pine bore in my pine tree.  Your photo is way better than mine.  My assassin bug was orange with black and white stripe legs.  Bizarre creature.  I just bought this lens and have been looking for this bug again to see if I could get a better shot.  No such luck.  Nicely done photo.', '2011-09-28 10:21:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6629036, 961967, 140310, '<td valign="top">I sure hope you weren''t in my neighborhood when you took this.</td>', 'I sure hope you weren''t in my neighborhood when you took this.', '2011-12-30 23:11:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6649021, 960778, 69246, '<td valign="top">Front legs do look a bit over sharpened. More-so, highlight a marquee around the area and I''ll bet you''ll see some very high highlights. So, it may not entirely be over sharpened but pushed blowing out some contrast.</td>', 'Front legs do look a bit over sharpened. More-so, highlight a marquee around the area and I''ll bet you''ll see some very high highlights. So, it may not entirely be over sharpened but pushed blowing out some contrast.', '2012-01-18 20:57:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6649557, 960778, 96751, '<td valign="top">Inconsequentially, yes.</td>', 'Inconsequentially, yes.', '2012-01-19 12:58:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6671378, 961778, 131284, '<td valign="top">4.7? I can understand your disappointment with this score. Sometimes I think it''s important to know when to disregard the score though. For a stock-look or landscape style shot my belief is the score is a fairly decent assessment of an image (usually). When it comes to "photography as art" though, which seems to be a hot subject in the forum right now, the score really means nothing and I think individual assessments of an image are all that''s important.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-02-11 12:09:23.</i></td>', '4.7? I can understand your disappointment with this score. Sometimes I think it''s important to know when to disregard the score though. For a stock-look or landscape style shot my belief is the score is a fairly decent assessment of an image (usually). When it comes to "photography as art" though, which seems to be a hot subject in the forum right now, the score really means nothing and I think individual assessments of an image are all that''s important.', '2012-02-11 12:08:39.000000', '2012-02-11 12:09:23.000000', 0),
(6883420, 961957, 15002, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!!<br/></td>', 'Awesome!!!', '2012-10-15 10:59:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6960853, 960778, 129807, '<td valign="top">I''ve just read the comments below and wow, didn''t you ever get a co-operative little bug! I haven''t tried too many of these really close macro shots of insects because I just do not have the patience and the little mongrels keep flying away on me. Oh how I wish I could capture a few this good. What flash/lighting did you use? The comments below indicate (and I agree) that it''s a tiny bit harsh, but I''d keep that if it meant the difference between ''OK detail'' and this much detail :) Great shot. Love the iridescent shine on both bugs.</td>', 'I''ve just read the comments below and wow, didn''t you ever get a co-operative little bug! I haven''t tried too many of these really close macro shots of insects because I just do not have the patience and the little mongrels keep flying away on me. Oh how I wish I could capture a few this good. What flash/lighting did you use? The comments below indicate (and I agree) that it''s a tiny bit harsh, but I''d keep that if it meant the difference between ''OK detail'' and this much detail :) Great shot. Love the iridescent shine on both bugs.', '2013-01-19 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7059981, 961231, 27812, '<td valign="top">Fantastic find. Love the thinker''s little hand.Great focus and use of DOF. On my screen, not recently calibrated, I miss some contrast and even a little color saturation. With a little tinkering this image will have a 3-D perspective/look/feel. You are doing good work.</td>', 'Fantastic find. Love the thinker''s little hand.Great focus and use of DOF. On my screen, not recently calibrated, I miss some contrast and even a little color saturation. With a little tinkering this image will have a 3-D perspective/look/feel. You are doing good work.', '2013-07-03 01:52:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7126752, 961430, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wow! Sorry I missed this wonderful image. In today''s low scoring challenges this is indeed an achievement Joe. WD on your HM.</td>', 'Wow! Sorry I missed this wonderful image. In today''s low scoring challenges this is indeed an achievement Joe. WD on your HM.', '2013-11-07 15:40:43.000000', NULL, 0),
